{"version":1,"content":"<p>經典日劇《悠長假期》女主角山口智子，與老公唐澤壽明結婚31年，出名是圈中模範夫婦。</p><p>向來低調的兩人，落實亮相下月31日播出的除夕特別節目，也是兩人婚後首次在螢光幕上同框。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;現年63歲的唐澤壽明與62歲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:04:02.460685+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:16:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:57:21.661874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:57:21.661874+00:00","content_hash":"0d410f9d680c9fa64cc451e3cd1506c360093b8af37d21f43064f1b21ab367c5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}